{"id":"L-meta-8470","title":"A step toward: No circuit of fan-in-two AND/OR gates with at most 124 gates computes the incidence function of the projective plane of order 4 (step 2 of 2)","formal_statement":"∀ (x1 : Finset (Finset (Fin (21 : ℕ)) × Finset (Fin (21 : ℕ)))), (∀ x2 ∈ x1, x2.1.Nonempty ∧ x2.2.Nonempty ∧ ∀ x4 ∈ x2.1, ∀ x6 ∈ x2.2, (↑x6 + (21 : ℕ) - ↑x4) % (21 : ℕ) ∈ [(0 : ℕ), (5 : ℕ), (7 : ℕ), (17 : ℕ), (20 : ℕ)]) → (∀ (x3 x4 : Fin (21 : ℕ)), (↑x4 + (21 : ℕ) - ↑x3) % (21 : ℕ) ∈ [(0 : ℕ), (5 : ℕ), (7 : ℕ), (17 : ℕ), (20 : ℕ)] → ∃ x6 ∈ x1, x3 ∈ x6.1 ∧ x4 ∈ x6.2) → (105 : ℕ) ≤ ∑ x4 ∈ x1, (x4.1.card + x4.2.card - (1 : ℕ))","statement_hash":"sha256:99bc6027f021419630f9f1bad7f4b3f0953773b02afaedbdf557243a60521174","plain_statement":"Step 2 of 2 of a checked cut of L-meta-4201.","status":"conjecture","barrier":null,"depends_on":[],"program":"meta_complexity","seat":null,"proposed_at":"2026-11-25T05:28:10.325Z","attempts":[],"kind":"helper","used_by":[],"status_at":"2026-11-25T05:28:10.325Z","layer":0}